        "committer": {
          "name": "Xiyang Wang",
          "email": "xiwang@ddn.com",
          "date": "2026-11-18 01:41:22.000000000",
          "tz": 480
        },
        "subject": "LU-21120 tests: re-disable sanityn test_32b",
        "message": "LU-21120 tests: re-disable sanityn test_32b\n\nsanityn test_32b measures lockless I/O, which is only entered after\nthe server returns -EUSERS in response to LDLM_FL_DENY_ON_CONTENTION.\nLU-14838 removed the client support that sets that flag, so the\nserver never returns -EUSERS and lockless_write_bytes remains zero.\nLU-12550 later re-enabled test_32b while rewriting contention\ndetection, so an old server plus a current client now runs the test\nand fails instead of exercising lockless I/O.\n\nRemove test_32b(). Delete the entire test function.\n\nFixes: 73f14d6c16d (\"LU-12550 ldlm: contention detection\")\nSigned-off-by: Xiyang Wang <xiwang@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: I528f16e34ea4f171aeba5e81a910fe42b223fa5b\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
  },
